{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19202","headline":"酬乐天请裴令公开春加宴 · 刘禹锡","name":"酬乐天请裴令公开春加宴","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"高名大位能兼有，恣意遨游是特恩。\n二室烟霞成步障，三川风物是家园。\n晨窥苑树韶光动，晚度河桥春思繁。\n弦管常调客常满，但逢花处即开樽。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘禹锡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19202.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19202","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}